  "statuteText": "659:103 Preservation of Challenge Affidavits. –\n\nThe forms completed by challengers and affidavits made by challenged voters as provided in RSA 659:27 and RSA 659:27-a shall be preserved in accordance with RSA 33-A:3-a."
